  <p id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0000" ref="qsd_v11_ya1_AA">仲德</persName>兄孫<persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0004" ref="726_jlm_j1k">文和</persName>，景和中，為征北義陽王<persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0017" ref="g9z_y41_l95">昶</persName>府佐。<persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0021" ref="g9z_y41_l95">昶</persName>于彭城奔魏，部曲皆散，<persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0033" ref="726_jlm_j1k">文和</persName>獨送至界上。<persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0041" ref="g9z_y41_l95">昶</persName>謂曰：「諸人皆去，卿有<rs id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:u0053" type="unresolved">老母</rs>，何獨不去？」<persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0062" ref="726_jlm_j1k">文和</persName>乃去。升明中，為巴陵內史。<persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0077" ref="16c_0og_lvl_A">沈攸之</persName>事起，<persName id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0083" ref="726_jlm_j1k">文和</persName>斬其<rs id="c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:u0087" type="unresolved">使</rs>，馳白齊武帝。及齊永明年中，曆青、冀、兗、益四州刺史。</p>
</text>
